 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "In a little town called Nazareth upon the Sabbath day",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 1.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He stood up in the synagogue the way he did each week",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They handed him the scroll of the prophet Isaiah",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.88,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He found the place where it was written and he began to speak",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 1.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The Spirit of the Lord GOD is upon me",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 47.46,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Because the LORD has anointed me",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 47.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "To bring good news to the poor",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 47.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He has sent me to bind up the brokenhearted",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 47.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "To proclaim liberty to the captives",
   "heard": 1,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 37.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And release to those who are bound",
   "heard": 0,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": null,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "To comfort all who mourn",
   "heard": 0,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": null,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "To proclaim the year of the LORD's favor",
   "heard": 1,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": null,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
